  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0132_41835d5ee59b.png\" style=\"width: 104px; height: 43px;\" /></p><p>Potential energy stored in inductor is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8746;</mo><mo>&#8733;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>RT</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfrac><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msqrt><mrow><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>"
  }
